AALE NABI WO SHAAM KA DARBAR YA ALI,<br>
 PESHE YAZEED ITRATE ATHAAR YA ALI<br>
<br>
DARBAR MAIN TALAB HUA JISDAM WO QAFELA,<br>
 ZAINAB KA FARTE YAAS SE DIL BAITH SA GAYA,<br>
 AB KYA BAYAAN KAREY KOI RUDAADE KARBALA,<br>
 HAI MUSKILAON MAIN ITRATE ATHAAR YA ALI<br>
<br>
BAAD-E-HUSSAIN ZULM KA JAARI HAI SILSILA,<br>
 GHURBAT KI SHAAM AUR WO SEHRA-E- KARBALA,<br>
 SAB JAL CHOOKE KHAYAAM TO CHCHEENI GAYI RIDA,<br>
 WO BEKASI WO ZAINAB-E-NACHAAR YA ALI<br>
<br>
JAKDA HUA RASAN MEIN ASEERAON KA KARWAAN,<br>
 HAIN BERIDA KHADI SAREY DARBAR BIBIYAAN,<br>
 SHIDDAT HAI TAP KI AUR HAI SAJJAD-E- NATAWAAN,<br>
 AB ZULME NARAWA KI HAI YELGHAAR YA ALI<br>
<br>
SAR NANGE AHLEBAITH THE BAZARE SHAAM THA,<br>
 NA MAHRAMAON KA CHAAR SOO EK IZDEHAAM THA,<br>
 SAR KO JHUKAE WARISE KHAIRUL ANAAM THA,<br>
 BEMAAR AB HAIN KITNA DILAFGAAR YA ALI<br>
<br>
DARBAR MEIN SAMAAN HAIN AJAB SHOR-O-SHAIN KA,<br>
 TASHTE TILA MEIN SAR HAIN SHAHE MASHRAQAIN KA,<br>
 KIS HAAL MEIN HAI DEKHIYE KUNBA HUSSAIN KA,<br>
 DARBAR MEIN HAIN HASHR KE AASAAR YA ALI<br>
<br>
HAD HOGAYI QAYAMATE KUBRA HUVI BAPA,<br>
 ZALIM KI WOH CHHADI WOLABE JAAN-E-FATIMA,<br>
 BINTE ALI YE KEHTI THI ZAALIM NA KAR JAFA,<br>
 HAIN SAR JHUKAE ABID-E-BIMAAR YA ALI<br>
<br>
MASOOM KE GALE ME BANDHI HAI JO REESMA,<br>
 YE HAAL HAI KE LETI HAI REH REH KE HICHKIYAN,<br>
 PHAILAKE HAATH KEHTI HAI AAJAO BABA JAAN,<br>
 POTI KE APNE DEKHIYE RUKHSAAR YA ALI<br>
<br>
HUM BEKASAON KA NASIR-O-YAWAR NAHIN RAHA,<br>
 ABBAS-E-BAWAFA SA DILAWAR NAHIN RAHA,<br>
 QASIM NAHIN RAHA MERA AKBAR NAHIN RAHA,<br>
 LAB PAR SOHAIL SAB KE THA HAR BAAR YA ALI